pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: vp-accent
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 50, 4, 28]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: vp-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 48, 1000, 34]
    content:
      style: "$subtitle"
      fontSize: 26
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>Vistas principales — Landing, Dashboard y Detalle de Clase</p>
  - elementId: vp-mock-1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 110, 360, 260]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [12000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$cardBg"
    shadow:
      blur: 10
      color: "#00000010"
      offset: [0, 3]
  - elementId: vp-m1-header
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 110, 360, 50]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [12000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: vp-m1-header-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [70, 118, 340, 34]
    content:
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$lightText"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>Landing Page (/)</strong></p>
  - elementId: vp-m1-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 180, 320, 170]
    content:
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      fontSize: 13
      color: "$text"
      align: [left, top]
      lineHeight: 1.5
      text: |
        <p>• Hero con preview de producto</p>
        <p>• Flujo de 3 pasos: curso → clase → repaso</p>
        <p>• Bento grid de outputs</p>
        <p>• Resumen, quiz, flashcards, recomendación</p>
        <p>• Planes de suscripción visibles</p>
  - elementId: vp-mock-2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [460, 110, 360, 260]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [12000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$cardBg"
    shadow:
      blur: 10
      color: "#00000010"
      offset: [0, 3]
  - elementId: vp-m2-header
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [460, 110, 360, 50]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [12000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$info"
  - elementId: vp-m2-header-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [470, 118, 340, 34]
    content:
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$lightText"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>Dashboard (/dashboard/)</strong></p>
  - elementId: vp-m2-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [480, 180, 320, 170]
    content:
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      fontSize: 13
      color: "$text"
      align: [left, top]
      lineHeight: 1.5
      text: |
        <p>• Tabs: cursos, clases, explorar, guardadas, preferencias</p>
        <p>• Header gamificado: racha, nivel, XP</p>
        <p>• Grid de cursos con periodo, clases, tags</p>
        <p>• Clases con badges de visibilidad y estado</p>
  - elementId: vp-mock-3
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [860, 110, 360, 260]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [12000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$cardBg"
    shadow:
      blur: 10
      color: "#00000010"
      offset: [0, 3]
  - elementId: vp-m3-header
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [860, 110, 360, 50]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [12000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: vp-m3-header-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [870, 118, 340, 34]
    content:
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$lightText"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>Detalle de Clase (/clase/&lt;pk&gt;/)</strong></p>
  - elementId: vp-m3-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [880, 180, 320, 170]
    content:
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      fontSize: 13
      color: "$text"
      align: [left, top]
      lineHeight: 1.5
      text: |
        <p>• Meta: badges de preguntas, IRT, verificado</p>
        <p>• Selector de intensidad: 5 / 10 / 15</p>
        <p>• Barra gamificada con nivel y racha</p>
        <p>• Acciones: repasar, pipeline, mapa, emparejar, completar</p>
  - elementId: vp-detail-card
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 400, 1160, 220]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [8000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "#e8f5e0"
  - elementId: vp-detail-icon
    elementType: icon
    bounds: [90, 430, 32, 32]
    iconName: "fas:code"
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
  - elementId: vp-detail-head
    elementType: text
    bounds: [90, 475, 400, 24]
    content:
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$primary"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>Implementación real en templates</strong></p>
  - elementId: vp-detail-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [90, 510, 1100, 90]
    content:
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$text"
      align: [left, top]
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: |
        <p>18 templates HTML en <strong>templates/learning/</strong> + base.html + landing pages. CSS custom con variables CSS, responsive mobile-first, dark mode soportado.</p>
        <p>Zero dependencias de build. Zero frameworks JS. Puro Django server-side rendering + CSS vanilla.</p>
        <p>SVGs inline para todos los iconos (fuego, rayo, libro, candado, link, globo) — sin emojis, consistentes en todos los OS.</p>
  - elementId: vp-footer-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 660, 40, 3]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"
